================================================================================
SUMMARY
================================================================================

Session successfully verified all Data_Cleanup_and_Cascade features.

All three features rely on Prisma's cascade delete configuration:
1. Canvas deletion cascades to notes, connections, and images
2. Folder deletion can either move canvases to root or delete them
3. Note deletion cascades to all related connections

The cascade deletes work at the database level via onDelete: Cascade
in the Prisma schema, ensuring referential integrity even if the
application code bypasses ORM operations.

Key files:
- prisma/schema.prisma: Cascade configuration
- app/api/canvases/[id]/route.ts: Canvas DELETE endpoint
- app/api/folders/[id]/route.ts: Folder DELETE with moveCanvasesToRoot option
- app/dashboard/page.tsx: Folder deletion confirmation modal

